## Code quality

Aligned with `C:\Projects\Roblox\roblox-starter` (канон стека) + `Mining/.cursor/rules/code-quality.mdc` где не конфликтует:

- `--!strict` Luau; typed public APIs (`export type`)
- Modules ~≤300 lines; split by responsibility when hard to read
- DI via `Module.new(deps)`; no `_G`; no hidden singletons
- Shared data tables only in `src/shared/data/` — no duplicated client/server balance
- Explicit `:destroy()` / connection cleanup
- **UI = React-Lua** (`jsdotlua/react` + `react-roblox`) + Flipper + `theme`/`useLayout` — см. `roblox-starter/.cursor/rules/ui-react.mdc`. Не писать HUD на raw `Instance.new`. Не Fusion.
- Prefer extending existing modules; **new** `RollService` / `StealService` / `LightService` / `BaseService` are expected in PROVE (GDD §8). `RebirthService` only post-PROVE.

